    "stop_reason": "success",
    "result_text": "Both tests pass reliably. The change is complete as a full-stack, additive change.\n\n## What I built\n\nAn invoice is now composed of **line items** (description, quantity, price each) and its amount is worked out for you as the sum of `qty \u00d7 unit price` \u2014 no more typing a single figure.\n\n**Database** (`V13__line_items.sql`)\n- New `line_items` table (`invoice_id`, `description`, `qty`, `unit_price`).\n- Relaxed the `invoices.amount` column (dropped the positive-only constraint, made it nullable, default 0) so an invoice can exist \u2014 and start empty \u2014 without a typed amount, since the total is now derived.\n\n**Server** (OfficeFloor REST)\n- Two new endpoints via new YAML + logic classes: `GET /api/invoices/{id}/line-items` (`ListInvoiceLineItems`) and `POST /api/invoices/{id}/line-items` (`CreateLineItem`), plus `LineItem`, `LineItemRepository`, `LineItemView`, `NewLineItem`.\n- `ListInvoices` and `ListAllInvoices` now compute each invoice's `amount` as `COALESCE(SUM(qty*unit_price), 0)` from its lines.\n- `TestSupportController` seeds `lineItems` per invoice, treats `amount` as optional, and `reset` truncates `line_items`.\n\n**Front-end** (`features/projects/feature.tsx`)\n- Each invoice row gets an `invoice-open-<id>` button; opening one swaps the invoice list for an `invoice-detail` view showing the `invoice-lineitems-table` (each `lineitem-row-<id>` with `lineitem-description`), the worked-out `invoice-amount`, and a `lineitem-form` (`-description`, `-qty`, `-unitprice`, `-submit`) to add another line. Adding a line refreshes the total.\n\nI kept it additive and local \u2014 no pinned scaffolding, router, or test spec touched, and no existing `data-testid` renamed or removed (the amount-based `invoice-form` is preserved).",
